Z||000000||coolcat||08-17-2001||03:50 AM||||With all the talk thats been going on lately about clear tail lights I was thinking. Instead of taking out your colored lenses, I might try and make clear lenses for the tail lights and side markers.If I'm successful would any one be interested? I would start out with GT lenses and smooth markers first and if all goes well I would do notchback lenses and ribbed markers. Right now I'm tring to make different colored lenses for  the PON/TIAC on the GT lights and these will replace the red ones and  be sold in kits of about 5 different colors.What do you guys think?<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/headbang.gif">  Gettin good players is easy,gettin them to play together is the hard part<p>[This message has been edited by coolcat (edited 08-17-2001).]||||reg||5
