Z||000007||Simple Fiero||08-19-2001||04:26 AM||||I the backs were clear too, but I just did the clear tails thing and it cost me all of 10 bucks (canadian). I bought some round red reflectors , cause in BC you have to a reflective surface, then I just used a dremel and hot glue to shape them right and put them on I wish I could show you but I can't cause I don't have a digital camera. Maybe I can take one out and snap a pic with my pute camera if you want to see it, I know it may sound stupid but all my friends are diggin it.||||reg||7
